// "Falaises Flanelle": cliffs at sunset (issue #110, the 10th circuit), after the guide « Conception
// des circuits » (docs/GAME_DESIGN.md § 16). Original layout, about 1530 m a lap,
// turning left: the start straight on the cliff top, 14 m up; two hairpins (left, right) along
// it, to the risky jump's corner on the edge (a tight corner to the left, its inside a drop, that
// a ramp crosses); along the edge to the glide ramp, and the glide down to the foot of the cliff;
// the snake back up (a hairpin to the left, one to the right, two tight turns, a hairpin to the
// right, two tight turns), along the foot of the cliff; the bulge round a giant needle of white
// stone, whose hidden road runs straight behind a stack of crates; the last corner, that the
// grass bridge crosses behind a panel that breaks under a boost. Five hairpins of 180° (a Normal
// bot drifts them), the bulge's S (left 150° between two right 75°), tight corners of 90°: no
// long soft curve, one long straight. The pieces of the shortcuts (the jump's corner, its
// landing and the glide; the bulge, the last corner and their paths) are the Corniche
// Cannelle's, mirrored (issues #107, #156: their gains and their hiding were tuned), with other
// covers; the rest is new.
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs, its points every 8 m along it (the parameters below
// follow them).
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north,
// -Z), then turn left. The grid sits on the straight behind point 0.
(
    name: "Falaises Flanelle",
    // Dressing (issue #11): the cliffs at sunset (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the same every time
    // (seed), and pieces placed by hand: checkered flags at the start line, a giant needle of
    // white stone that hides the hidden road, another one by the jump's corner.
    biome: "Falaises",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "darkness-road",
    decor_seed: 1010,
    props: [
        (model: "racing-kit/flagCheckers", at: 0.0, side: Both, height: 4.0, radius: 0.9, gap: 1.8),
